WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.890
- So, you shot the movie in London right?

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:02.723
You were saying?
(audience applauds)

00:00:02.723 --> 00:00:03.695
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:03.695 --> 00:00:04.528
- So, like did you do anything fun

00:00:04.528 --> 00:00:05.910
while you were there or just work?

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:07.290
- No, I got to do a lot of fun stuff.

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.630
Like I, it was a six week
shoot, it was really crammed

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:10.650
and I worked for two weeks,

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.150
then the kids came out for two weeks

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:13.260
and then, I shot for two weeks.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.810
We ate our way across London.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:16.742
It was...

00:00:16.742 --> 00:00:17.575
- They have great Indian Food.

00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:19.170
- They have, Dishoom, the best.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.003
- So good.

00:00:20.003 --> 00:00:21.810
- And they have like, there's
this incredible Italian place

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:23.700
called Lina Stores, we just ate our way.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.980
And we took the kids
like, on the London Eye.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:26.813
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:26.813 --> 00:00:27.646
- And there's really great parks there,

00:00:27.646 --> 00:00:28.680
it was, it was wonderful.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.090
- My kids on the London Eye was hilarious,

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.490
because they started out, they
were so excited at the edge

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.680
and then, like slowly they backed up.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:35.513
- Right, right, right.
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:00:35.513 --> 00:00:36.680
- When it started going high.
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:37.513
- It's kinda intense.

00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:39.118
- Yeah, they were like,
"Yeah, this is so great".

00:00:39.118 --> 00:00:39.951
- [Kristen] Yeah.

00:00:39.951 --> 00:00:40.784
- It was like...
(audience laughs)

00:00:40.784 --> 00:00:42.210
I was like, "Why are you moonwalking?

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:43.110
Like what's happening?

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.101
What are you doing right now?"

00:00:44.101 --> 00:00:46.470
I heard that you also
did something really fun,

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:48.389
involving stripping.
- Oh, my gosh, so...

00:00:48.389 --> 00:00:49.230
(audience laughs)

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.221
Yes.

00:00:50.221 --> 00:00:51.054
- I need to know this story.

00:00:51.054 --> 00:00:51.960
- I can't believe I didn't lead with that.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:56.640
In London, I had a transformative
experience emotionally,

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.491
because Ben took me to see "Magic Mike".

00:01:00.491 --> 00:01:01.789
(audience applauds)

00:01:01.789 --> 00:01:02.622
And...
- Which one?

00:01:02.622 --> 00:01:04.770
- He took, okay, so Karan
Soni is also in the movie,

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:07.440
so Ben Platt, Karan Soni,
Allison Janney and I,

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:10.620
went to see "Magic Mike" at this casino.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.410
Which like, those things if
you're pitching a night to me,

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:14.970
are not normally my vibe.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:15.803
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:15.803 --> 00:01:16.740
- I'm like, "Oh, maybe, sure".

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:17.670
I would get nervous.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.320
- Yeah, you don't commit
so you can back out.

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.280
- Exactly.
- Yeah.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:23.139
- It was passionate, it was gorgeous.

00:01:23.139 --> 00:01:23.972
(audience chuckles)

00:01:23.972 --> 00:01:25.830
There was audience participation.

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:30.360
It had story, I like came
out, it had empowerment.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:34.389
I came out like, feeling the
London air as like a new woman.

00:01:34.389 --> 00:01:38.160
I can't describe it, but it
is not just a strip show.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:40.320
So, see "Magic Mike" if you can.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:41.437
That's my, that's what I'm saying.

00:01:41.437 --> 00:01:42.270
(audience applauds)

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:43.890
- I love how passionate you are.

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.349
- It was so much fun.
- I've never seen it.

00:01:46.349 --> 00:01:49.110
- It's not so much, it's
sexy, but it's more like,

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:52.920
passionate and beautiful
and really empowering

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.890
for both males and females
and everyone in between.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:59.248
And it's just like, raucous
but also really safe.

00:01:59.248 --> 00:02:00.870
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:01.920
- I just imagine like,

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.420
I imagine this coming out of a man,

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:04.957
coming out of a strip club and being like,

00:02:04.957 --> 00:02:06.917
"You don't understand,
there's so much story".

00:02:06.917 --> 00:02:07.750
(audience laughs)

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.300
- There's so much story.
- There's so much story.

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:10.950
- It was beautiful and I felt so safe.

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:13.548
- It's not just about the
wings, Hooters are great.

00:02:13.548 --> 00:02:14.381
(Kristen laughs)

00:02:14.381 --> 00:02:16.320
It's like, it's like
I just heard it coming

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.370
from a male perspective,

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.050
trying to sell me on it
and I'm like, "Okay".

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:20.550
- This is not that, this is not that.

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:22.275
- No, no, even if that is, you do you.

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.343
- Right.

